# Mend.io

&gt; Mend.io is an application security platform that unifies application security testing and AI security in one system. It gives engineering and security teams full software supply chain visibility, prioritises exploitable vulnerabilities over raw vulnerability counts, and automates remediation to reduce mean time to remediate.

Mend.io covers three areas: application security (static application security testing, software composition analysis, container and dynamic testing), AI security (AI bill of materials inventory, model governance, red teaming, runtime guardrails), and automated dependency management through the Renovate family of tools.

Formerly known as WhiteSource; rebranded to Mend.io in 2022.

## Platform

- [Mend AppSec](https://www.mend.io/mend-platform/): Application security platform combining static application security testing and software composition analysis with AI-powered remediation.
- [Mend AI](https://www.mend.io/mend-ai/): AI security posture management across the AI application lifecycle — inventory, testing, governance and runtime protection.
- [Mend Renovate](https://www.mend.io/renovate/): The Renovate family of automated dependency management tools, including the open source project.
- [Mend Renovate Enterprise](https://www.mend.io/mend-renovate/): Dependency management tools for automating updates at enterprise scale.
- [Pricing](https://www.mend.io/pricing/): Per-contributing-developer pricing for Mend AppSec, Mend AI and Mend Renovate Enterprise.

## Application security

- [SAST](https://www.mend.io/sast/): Static application security testing for human-written and AI-generated code.
- [SCA](https://www.mend.io/sca/): Software composition analysis with reachability analysis, EPSS and CVSS 4.0 prioritisation.
- [Code scanning](https://www.mend.io/code-scanning/): Continuous code scanning built to reduce false positives and developer friction.
- [DAST](https://www.mend.io/dast/): Dynamic application security testing for running applications.
- [API security](https://www.mend.io/api-security/): API security testing and protection against API exploitation.
- [Container security scanning](https://www.mend.io/container-security-scanning/): Container vulnerability scanning for images, secrets and reachable risk.
- [SBOM management](https://www.mend.io/sbom/): Automated software bill of materials generation in SPDX and CycloneDX, with VEX.
- [Software supply chain security](https://www.mend.io/software-supply-chain-security/): Protection against malicious packages, protestware and dependency confusion.
- [Open source security](https://www.mend.io/open-source-security/): Open source vulnerability detection, prioritisation and remediation.
- [Open source license compliance](https://www.mend.io/open-source-license-compliance/): Automated license policy enforcement across copyleft and permissive licenses.
- [Dependency updates](https://www.mend.io/dependency-updates/): Automated dependency updates with Merge Confidence ratings.
- [Repository integration](https://www.mend.io/repo-integration/): Scanning inside GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket and Azure Repos.
- [EOL support](https://www.mend.io/eol-support/): Continued support for end of life software and unmaintained components.
- [Scalability](https://www.mend.io/scalability/): Enterprise application security at scale.

## AI security

- [AI-BOM](https://www.mend.io/ai-bom/): Automated AI bill of materials — continuous discovery of models, agents, MCP servers, RAG pipelines and shadow AI.
- [AI red teaming](https://www.mend.io/ai-red-teaming/): Automated adversarial testing of conversational AI for prompt injection, jailbreaks and data leakage.
- [Runtime guardrails](https://www.mend.io/runtime-guardrails/): Real-time inspection of LLM inputs and outputs in production.
- [System prompt hardening](https://www.mend.io/system-prompt-hardening/): Securing the AI instruction layer against prompt injection.
- [AI generated code security](https://www.mend.io/ai-generated-code-security/): Scanning code from Copilot, Cursor and similar assistants at the point of generation.
- [AI powered application security](https://www.mend.io/ai-powered-application-security/): Securing applications that embed AI models and agents.
- [AI based remediation](https://www.mend.io/ai-based-remediation/): AI-generated fixes for static analysis and open source findings.
- [AI behavioral risks](https://www.mend.io/ai-behavioral-risks/): AI model security and management of unpredictable model and agent behaviour.

## Compliance and governance

- [Compliance](https://www.mend.io/compliance/): Capability mapping to the EU AI Act, Cyber Resilience Act, EO 14028, NIST SSDF, NIST AI RMF, ISO 42001, ISO 27001 and the OWASP LLM Top 10.

